  "content": "\n\nIcarus 是一个小型模组，添加了多种色彩斑斓且独特的翅膀，可装备在背部（Curios）或披风（Trinkets）槽位中。\n\n翅膀仅有两项缺点：飞行时会消耗饥饿值，且穿戴盔甲时会降低最大速度。穿戴的盔甲越多，减速效果越明显，最多会降低至正常最大速度的 2/3（可配置）。此外，还有一个标签可通过数据包添加翅膀，使其在飞行时不消耗饥饿值。\n\n# 来看看 [Zeddy](https://www.youtube.com/@zeddyminecraft) 制作的精彩展示：\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/yTYI6g2g07E\" title=\"YouTube 视频播放器\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n# 全新耐力系统！\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/kyCy4u1pbSw\" title=\"YouTube 视频播放器\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n---\n\n### 合成配方：\n![Crafting Recipes](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/723db6c848c7302197286a87aa3f3b12f178ac52.png)\n\n---\n\n<table align=\"center\">\n    <tr>\n        <th><b>加入我的 Discord</b></th>\n        <th><b>支持我的 Ko-Fi！</b></th>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n        <th><a href=\"https://cammiescorner.dev/discord\"><img src=\"https://cammiescorner.dev/images/extras/discord.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" title=\"Cammie's Corner Discord\" alt=\"Cammie's Corner Discord\"></a></th>\n        <th><a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/camellias/tiers\"><img src=\"https://cammiescorner.dev/images/extras/kofi.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" title=\"Cammie's Corner Patreon\" alt=\"Cammie's Corner Patreon\"></a></th>\n    </tr>\n</table>",
